{"segs": ["PA_ja_173:0.4"], "en": "3. The Monkey Jātaka “Dear father,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_173:1.1", "PA_ja_173:1.2"], "en": "this young brahmin boy is leaning against the base of a palm tree;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_173:1.3"], "en": "“There is indeed this small house;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_173:1.4"], "en": "come, let us give it to him.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_173:2.1"], "en": "“Do not urge me, dear father!”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_173:2.2"], "en": "It would not defile our little hut;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_173:2.3", "PA_ja_173:2.4"], "en": "such a face as this belongs to a brahmin of virtuous conduct.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
